    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaika na shitabo shido",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla namona malaika ūngī wa makaya alīfuma ng'wigūlū; walī azwalile ilunde, ū kū ntwe gokwe olī n'ita lya baashi. Ū būshū bokwe bong'wekaga gītī līīmi, hama a magūlū gakwe gaalī gītī ng'hīngī ja moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu nkono gwakwe walī na shitabo shido shikundūlilwe. Wīmīīla ūpanda ha nyanza ū gūgūlū gokwe ū go būlyo, ū go lūmoso ūpanda ha sī nyūmu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūhamuka n'ilaka itaale gītī lya shimba īlīzuumīīla; aho ohamuka gīko mihilimo mpungatī yūyomba na malaka gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihilimo yenīyo aho yayomba, ū nene nibeeja beeja gīkī nandye kwandīka; alīyo niigwa ilaka kūfuma ng'wigūlū līlīhaya gīkī, “Ī mihayo īyo yahayiwa na mihilimo mpungatī yenīyo ībisage gete, wībambīle, ūtizūyandīka!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika ūyo nakamona wīmīīlaga ha nyanza na ha sī nyūmu ūbūūcha ū nkono gokwe ū gwa būlyo, oolota ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wilahīla mu lina lyakwe ūyo alī mpanga kūshisha shiku jose; ū nseemi w'igūlū na shose īsho shilīmo, nī sī nī shose īsho shilīmo, pye na a manyanza nī shose īsho shilīmo; ūhaya gīkī, “Lyashilaga ī likanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu shikū j'ilaka lya ng'wa malaika wa mpungatī, ūlū wegeela kūlīng'ang'aaja ī lipembe lyakwe, īkūshikīīla ī mihayo ya ng'wa Mulungu īyo ayībisīle, īyo wabawīla a batūmami bakwe a bahangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lilaka īlo nakaliigwa kūfuma ng'wigūlū nūliigwa hangī līlīhaya gīkī, “Jaga ūkashisole ī shitabo īsho shikundūlilwe, īsho shilī mu nkono go ng'wa malaika, ūyo wapandaga ha nyanza na ha sī nyūmu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūja ho a halī malaika ng'wenūyo, nūkang'wīla aninhe ī shitabo. Ūninha kūnū alīniwīla gīkī, “Shanukūlage ūshilye; ū mu nomo shikūkūnonela gītī būūkī, alīyo ū mu nda shikūkūlūlīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūshisola ī shitabo ī shido shenīsho nūshilya ng'hana, ū mu nomo gwane shikanona gītī būūkī, alīyo aho namala ū kūshilya nandya kwigwa būlūlū ū mu nda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būniwīla gīkī, “Shiigelile ūfunye hangī būhangi kūlwa banhū ba mahanga na ndīmi ningī, na kū batemi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
